Running the Networks with following command: 
To Change the Parameters of all Networks use config.py

python -m baseline.ann.Training
python -m baseline.cnn.Training
python -m baseline.scnn.Training
python -m baseline.snn.Training

python -m SynSurrogateGrad.snn.Training
python -m SynSurrogateGrad.scnn.Training



You need to change the config in the plotting folder to the right nn folder.
python -m plotting.GetBestAccuracy
python -m plotting.PlotSigmoid_SigmoidPrime
python -m plotting.PlotTraining

This commands are used to create the plots for the presentation
python -m plotting.CompareTraining_CNN
python -m plotting.CompareTraining_FFN
python -m plotting.PlotCompareDivergence_SCNN
python -m plotting.PlotCompareDivergence_SNN
python -m plotting.PlotDivergenceLayerwise_SCNN
python -m plotting.PlotDivergenceLayerwise_SNN